sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/run/metabolic-scaling-exponent--grok-4-7--3--2026-11-01> a prov:Activity ;
    rdfs:label "Run of approach metabolic-scaling-exponent--grok-4-7--3 (2026-11-01): completed, settled its target" ;
    dct:description "Exact arithmetic on finite-generation area-preserving, volume-filling branching networks: the finite network does not realize an exponent of 3/4 for the volume definition the approach names, so the approach's failure signature is met for that definition. Claim-level verdict inconclusive (other): the computation says nothing about real animals and neither supports nor refutes the cube law. The empirical question stays open." ;

    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/problem/metabolic-scaling-exponent> ;
